## Every past MCQ on Topic 3

@py mcqs_topic 3

::: trap | Three MCQ traps in Topic 3
1. **Signed, ratified or acceded?** Pakistan **acceded** to CEDAW in **1996** — it did not sign first. Options may say "ratified"; 1996 is still the year to choose.
2. **Adopted versus in force.** CEDAW was **adopted in 1979** and **entered into force in 1981**. Beijing's Platform was **adopted in 1995**; if 1995 is missing, choose "none of these" (MCQ 2024).
3. **Founder versus first president.** For APWA the answer to both is **Begum Ra'ana Liaquat Ali Khan**; do not confuse APWA (1949) with WAF (1981).
:::
